[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708662688","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103844#issuecomment-2708662688","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103844","id":2708662688,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hcumg","user":{"login":"youer0219","id":145340318,"node_id":"U_kgDOCKm3ng","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145340318?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/youer0219","html_url":"https://github.com/youer0219","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youer0219/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youer0219/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youer0219/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youer0219/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youer0219/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youer0219/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youer0219/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youer0219/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youer0219/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-09T04:18:07Z","updated_at":"2025-03-09T04:18:07Z","body":"I feel that my editor is fine, but the game starts much slower.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708662688/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708693895","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103844#issuecomment-2708693895","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103844","id":2708693895,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hc2OH","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-09T06:21:37Z","updated_at":"2025-10-18T05:21:50Z","body":"There is a good chance this is caused by shader transpilation (converting the shaders to the format needed by D3D). \n\nSee the videos here that show the load time improvements from using baked shaders in D3D12 specifically https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102552 (also note that Vulkan doesn't have the same issue)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708693895/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708980651","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103844#issuecomment-2708980651","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103844","id":2708980651,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hd8Or","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-09T17:39:27Z","updated_at":"2025-03-09T17:39:27Z","body":"> also note that Vulkan doesn't have the same issue\n\nI thought Vulkan, Dx12, and Metals are alike (as they all took the inspiration from the AMD Mantle API). Is there anything specific to DX12 that requires this extra step? Don't we also compile the shaders to SPIR-V on Vulkan?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708980651/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708986080","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103844#issuecomment-2708986080","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103844","id":2708986080,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hd9jg","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-09T17:51:12Z","updated_at":"2025-03-09T17:51:12Z","body":"> > also note that Vulkan doesn't have the same issue\n> \n> I thought Vulkan, Dx12, and Metals are alike (as they all took the inspiration from the AMD Mantle API). Is there anything specific to DX12 that requires this extra step? Don't we also compile the shaders to SPIR-V on Vulkan?\n\nThey all use different intermediate formats, Vulkan uses SPIRV, D3D12 uses DXIL, and Metal uses Metal IR. \n\nSince D3D12 and metal can't use SPIRV directly, we need the transpilation step I mentioned above.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708986080/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708989481","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103844#issuecomment-2708989481","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103844","id":2708989481,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hd-Yp","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-09T17:58:27Z","updated_at":"2025-03-09T17:58:27Z","body":">  we need the transpilation step I mentioned above.\n\nAh, so we are not emitting DXIL and Metal IR directly; instead, we are always emitting SPIRV and then transpiling it to another format. I see, that's sad. Thanks for the explanation.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708989481/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708999070","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103844#issuecomment-2708999070","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103844","id":2708999070,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6heAue","user":{"login":"maidopi-usagi","id":33864304,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODY0MzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33864304?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi","html_url":"https://github.com/maidopi-usagi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-09T18:17:55Z","updated_at":"2025-03-09T18:17:55Z","body":"Tested on my machine.\n(Godot v4.4.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3090 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-13700F (24 threads))\n\nI can't reproduce the same problem, both rendering backend starts without much stuck. Here's a comparison between vulkan(L) and dx12(R) with `--benchmark` argument.\n\nI'm wondering if this is caused by some kinds failure of shadercache?\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d719e260-4642-4a2f-8364-e94e509a9e12)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708999070/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2709001242","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103844#issuecomment-2709001242","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103844","id":2709001242,"node_id":"IC_kw