 --display-driver windows --rendering-driver d3d12 --quit --quiet\n  Time (mean ± σ):      1.029 s ±  0.007 s    [User: 0.557 s, System: 0.368 s]\n  Range (min … max):    1.021 s …  1.041 s    10 runs\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2709799814/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2709999797","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103844#issuecomment-2709999797","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103844","id":2709999797,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hh1C1","user":{"login":"maidopi-usagi","id":33864304,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODY0MzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33864304?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi","html_url":"https://github.com/maidopi-usagi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maidopi-usagi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-10T09:50:23Z","updated_at":"2025-03-10T09:50:23Z","body":"After I updated my nvidia graphics driver to the same 572.47 version, and can reproduce the issue. I believe it's related 