eption: Program crashed with signal 11\nEngine version: Godot Engine v4.6.dev4.official (bd2ca13c6f3a5198eac035c855dcd1759e077313)\n```\nI cannot get a compiled debug version of `bd2ca13c6` to get backtrace to work for some reason. It spams `ERROR: Condition \"err != VK_SUCCESS\" is true. Returning: ERR_CANT_CREATE` when trying to open the project despite the fact that I've changed the project setting to dx12.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3595732867/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3600295390","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103844#issuecomment-3600295390","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103844","id":3600295390,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WmCXe","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T05:51:41Z","updated_at":"2025